# Line endings: LF in the repository AND in every working tree.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) checks files out as
# CRLF while Prettier's endOfLine defaults to "lf" — so `npm run format:check`
# fails on every checked-out file on Windows while passing in CI on Linux.
# `eol=lf` pins the working tree too, so the whole team sees the same bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be line-ending converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf  binary
